# Sound Atlas — environment variables
#
# This project is a static site. Nothing here is required to build or run it, and
# the repository ships with no credentials of any kind.
#
# The only optional value is a Freesound API key, which is NOT used by the shipped
# build. Freesound requires an OAuth2/API key per application and its preview URLs
# are only meant for that application, so the adapter is intentionally not wired in.
# If you fork this project and want to add Freesound, put your key here — never in
# source, and never in a commit.
#
# VITE_FREESOUND_API_KEY=

# Optional: override the map tile host if you run your own tile server.
# The default is the public OpenStreetMap tile service, which has a usage policy:
# https://operations.osmfoundation.org/policies/tiles/
#
# VITE_TILE_URL=https://tile.openstreetmap.org/{z}/{x}/{y}.png
